  <h1>About Armand Sallé</h1>

  <p>
    I am a founding and senior product engineer based in Angers, France. I build
    B2B and B2C software, especially products with complex operational
    workflows, demanding internal tools, and a need for close collaboration
    between engineering and the business.
  </p>

  <p>
    My strongest work happens in small teams where engineers are expected to
    understand users, question assumptions, and take responsibility for
    outcomes. I combine TypeScript, React, Node.js, product discovery, system
    design, delivery tooling, and AI-assisted execution.
  </p>

  <h2>Experience</h2>

  <p>
    I have worked on renovation financing at Ecair, pet insurance at Dalma, and
    a large anonymous operational B2B platform as a freelance senior product
    engineer. Across those roles I have owned product decisions, built internal
    tooling, improved CI and preview environments, and helped teams keep their
    architecture coherent as products grew.
  </p>

  <p>
    I also write technical articles about frontend patterns and production
    implementation details. The examples are intended to be useful to working
    engineers and include complete context wherever possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Working together</h2>

  <p>
    I work remotely and can collaborate regularly with teams in Paris. For
    selected freelance or founding opportunities, send an introduction to
    <a href="mailto:armand.salle@gmail.com">armand.salle@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>
